    "title": "Maury County library director receives raise - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ANDREW PEARSON ,\n16 hours ago The Maury County Commission filled two open seats on the County Library Board and approved a raise for the library director last week. Three women, Kara Williams, Carla Walker and Rita Parks, were nominated for two open seats on the library board. Williams received the county representative seat with 11 of 20 votes and Walker was chosen for the seat representing the City of Columbia by acclamation. Read full article",
